# Full per-benchmark job output is retained locally or on the execution host.
# Commit only small processed summaries; keep generated benchmark lists local.
results-*.txt
stats-*.txt
gapset-*.txt
!stats-*-processed.txt
# errors-*.txt is one line per failed benchmark and is only written when
# something failed, so it is small by nature and worth tracking: it is the
# record of which benchmarks crashed and why.  Not ignored, deliberately.
